  "title": "· CELINE Cube Logo-Print Canvas Bag ·",
  "original_title": "CELINE Cube 标志印花帆布手袋",
  "excerpt": "CELINE expands its Triomphe Frame line with the Cube, a compact geometric handbag blending antique vanity-case design with signature monogram canvas and clasp.",
