    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Cube is the newest addition to CELINE's Triomphe Frame handbag family, a deft marriage of antique vanity-case design and modern geometric lines. Its compact cubic silhouette is paired with a metal frame closure, the monogram canvas nods to the house's signature codes, and the Triomphe clasp remains the undisputed focal point.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
