    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The CELINE Cube made its debut in creative director Michael Rider's first collection for the house. Crisp and compact, its cubic structure draws on the antique vanity case while echoing such archival styles as the Triomphe vanity case and the Box Cuir Triomphe.",
