    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Metal Frame ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "As the latest member of the Triomphe Frame family, the Cube carries on the line's signature frame construction. The metal frame system keeps the cubic shape from losing its lines and lends the body a touch of old-world charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear close-up view",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The frame is crafted in gold-finish brass, mirror-polished to a gleaming shine. At its center sits a Triomphe clasp: a light press releases the top flap, while a hinged back allows the case to open wide for easy access.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
