    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Soft-Box Silhouette ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The body is made from the house's most recognizable honey-colored Triomphe Canvas, trimmed in natural calfskin and lined in lambskin. The light, soft-box silhouette offsets the formality of the metal frame, exuding a relaxed, languid French spirit.",
