    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Adjustable Strap ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The strap threads directly through openings on either side of the flap, and its 17cm–31cm range allows for hand-carry or shoulder wear. Crafted in natural calfskin with visible topstitching, it sits in perfect harmony with the vintage-inspired monogram body and will develop a distinctive patina over time.",
