          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Open the bag and you'll find a thoughtful mirror set into the underside of the flap, handy for touch-ups and quick checks so you look polished wherever you are.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/kku4c9k/d2494a7947aead48.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/kku4c9k/0492b13d5b241df4.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The boxy interior holds a slightly thicker wallet, tissues, a powder compact, keys and the like. Paired with everyday outfits or a dressed-up little dress, this refined little cube looks elegant and composed either way.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
