      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE Cube monogram handbag, designer Michael Rider. Dimensions 12.5cm wide x 12.5cm high x 12.5cm deep. Weight 545g. Retail price ¥27,500",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE is a celebrated French fashion house founded in 1945 by designer Céline Vipiana and now part of the LVMH group. Since February 2018, Hedi Slimane has served as artistic, creative and image director, adding menswear to the women's collections. since 1945 from Paris",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
